whisper.cpp and ggml
https://github.com/ggml-org/whisper.cpp, commit 482279b8a18855ba741d7b88c30fcb3874691f59
(git submodule third_party/whisper.cpp; compiled into src/wasm/czechspeech-mt.wasm, czechspeech-st.wasm and
czechspeech-webgpu.wasm, the last one with ggml's WebGPU backend and its WGSL shaders)

native/czechspeech_wasm.c is adapted from the CzechSpeech Android SDK's JNI glue, which follows parts of
whisper.cpp examples/whisper.android (same licence).

Modified: czechspeech-webgpu.wasm is built from this commit with native/patches/ggml-webgpu-q4_0-mat-mat.patch
applied to ggml's WebGPU backend (a new Q4_0 matrix-multiplication shader, mul_mat_q4_0_tile.wgsl, and its
selection in ggml-webgpu-shader-lib.hpp; written for CzechSpeech (Moravian AI) in 2026 and offered under the same MIT
licence as ggml).
czechspeech-mt.wasm and czechspeech-st.wasm are built from the unmodified commit.
